cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with the datasets it was run on."
title: "wearable-witness"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-03
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ANcpLua/wearable-witness"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nachtmann
    given-names: Alexander
abstract: >-
  Holds a wearable's reported heart rate against a reference recording and
  reports agreement with confidence intervals, or not_evaluated when the
  evidence is insufficient. Inputs are hashed, analysis policy is serialised
  with every report, and three known-answer controls run with every result.
